      "text": "Route: /docs/terminal (inside FlowJob, inherits fey-scope dark theme)\nAesthetic: Futuristic cyber — brick #B8333E, bone #FAFAF7, ink #000, grain overlay, Fraunces + Space Grotesk + JetBrains Mono\nContent: 4 markdown articles (getting-started, fog-lens, arc-lens, reading-data) — Bahasa Indonesia + English terms\nComponents: Sidebar.tsx (sticky rail + mobile drawer), Toc.tsx (scroll-spy), Markdown.tsx (react-markdown + custom renderers)\nScreenshots: 4 hero PNGs auto-captured via Playwright from localhost:5000/terminal-preview\nlib/docs.ts: Reused from FlowJob (content/docs/terminal/*.md parsed with gray-matter)",
